  "title": "SB 1626 (109th General Assembly): As enacted, establishes an online voter registration system beginning July 1, 2017. - Amends TCA Title 2, Chapter 2, Part 1.",
  "urls": [
    "https://legiscan.com/TN/bill/SB1626/2015",
